title: Finance
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: fiscal_policy_timer == 0 and finance_minister_party = "Bolshevik"
tags: sovnarkom, government
card-image: img/finance.PNG
on-arrival: {!
    Q.gdp_growth = 0;
    Q.gdp_growth_display = 1;

    Q.inflation = 0;
    Q.monthly_inflation_disp = 0;
    Q.inflation_disp = 0;

    Q.unemployment = 0;
    Q.unemployment_display = 0;

    Q.national_debt = 0;
    Q.national_debt_display = 0;

    Q.budget_balance = 0;
    Q.budget_balance_display = 0;

    Q.industrial_output = 0;
    Q.industrial_output_display = 0;

    Q.agricultural_output = 0;
    Q.agricultural_output_display = 0;

    Q.factory_utilization = 0;
    Q.factory_utilization_display = 0;

    Q.rail_capacity = 0;
    Q.rail_capacity_display = 0;

    Q.exports = 0;
    Q.exports_display = 0;

    Q.imports = 0;
    Q.imports_display = 0;

    Q.trade_balance = 0;
    Q.trade_balance_display = 0;

    Q.services_income = 0;
    Q.services_income_display = 0;

    Q.current_account = 0;
    Q.current_account_display = 0;

    Q.long_term_capital = 0;
    Q.long_term_capital_display = 0;

    Q.short_term_capital = 0;
    Q.short_term_capital_display = 0;

    Q.capital_account = 0;
    Q.capital_account_display = 0;

    Q.errors_omissions = 0;
    Q.errors_omissions_display = 0;

    Q.reserve_change = 0;
    Q.reserve_change_display = 0;

    Q.income_tax_display = 0;
    Q.property_tax_display = 0;
    Q.business_tax_display = 0;
    Q.monopolies_display = 0;
    Q.customs_display = 0;

    Q.railway_revenue = 0;
    Q.enterprises_revenue = 0;

    Q.government_functions_display = 0;

    Q.sovnarkom_expend = 0;
    Q.foreignaffairs_expend = 0;
    Q.military_expend = 0;
    Q.enlightenment_expend = 0;
    Q.internal_expend = 0;
    Q.railways_expend = 0;
    Q.trade_expend = 0;
    Q.finance_expend = 0;
    Q.justice_expend = 0;
    Q.labor_expend = 0;
    Q.agriculture_expend = 0;
    Q.foodsupply_expend = 0;
    Q.nationalities_expend = 0;
    Q.welfare_expend = 0;

    Q.interest_display = 0;
    Q.indemnities_display = 0;

    Q.income = 0;
    Q.expenditure = 0;
  Q.fiscal_policy_timer += 2; Q.week_actions += 1
!}



= Fiscal Policy

<div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:20px; align-items:flex-start; width:100%;">

  <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->

  <div style="flex:1; min-width:300px;">

    <!-- MACROECONOMY -->

    <div style="border:2px solid #666; border-radius:6px; padding:12px; margin-bottom:20px;">

      <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
        Macroeconomy
      </div>
      <hr>

      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr>
          <td>Economic Growth</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ gdp_growth_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Inflation</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ monthly_inflation_disp +]% ([+ inflation_disp +]% p.a.)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Unemployment</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ unemployment_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>National Debt</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ national_debt_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Budget Balance</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ budget_balance_display +]</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

    </div>


    <!-- PRODUCTION -->

    <div style="border:2px solid #666; border-radius:6px; padding:12px; margin-bottom:20px;">

      <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
        Production
      </div>
      <hr>

      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr>
          <td>Industrial Output</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ industrial_output_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Agricultural Output</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ agricultural_output_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Factory Utilization</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ factory_utilization_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Rail Capacity</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ rail_capacity_display +]</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

    </div>


    <!-- BALANCE OF PAYMENTS -->

    <div style="border:2px solid #666; border-radius:6px; padding:12px;">

      <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
        Balance of Payments
      </div>
      <hr>

      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr>
          <td style="width:50%; vertical-align:top; padding-right:12px;">

            <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
              Current Account
            </div>

            <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
              <tr>
                <td>Merchandise Exports</td>
                <td style="text-align:right;">[+ exports_display +]</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Merchandise Imports</td>
                <td style="text-align:right;">[+ imports_display +]</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Trade Balance</td>
                <td style="text-align:right;">[+ trade_balance_display +]</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Services &amp; Income, Net</td>
                <td style="text-align:right;">[+ services_income_display +]</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><b>Current Account</b></td>
                <td style="text-align:right;"><b>[+ current_account_display +]</b></td>
              </tr>
            </table>

          </td>

          <td style="width:50%; vertical-align:top; padding-left:12px;">

            <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
              Capital Account
            </div>

            <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
              <tr>
                <td>Long-Term Capital, Net</td>
                <td style="text-align:right;">[+ long_term_capital_display +]</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Short-Term Capital, Net</td>
                <td style="text-align:right;">[+ short_term_capital_display +]</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><b>Capital Account</b></td>
                <td style="text-align:right;"><b>[+ capital_account_display +]</b></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Errors &amp; Omissions</td>
                <td style="text-align:right;">[+ errors_omissions_display +]</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><b>Change in Reserves</b></td>
                <td style="text-align:right;"><b>[+ reserve_change_display +]</b></td>
              </tr>
            </table>

          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>

    </div>

  </div>


  <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->

  <div style="flex:1; min-width:300px;">

    <!-- BUDGET -->

    <div style="border:2px solid #666; border-radius:6px; padding:12px; margin-bottom:20px; font-size:0.9em;">

      <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
        Budget
      </div>
      <hr>

      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; table-layout:fixed;">
        <tr>

          <!-- REVENUE -->

          <td style="width:50%; vertical-align:top; padding-right:10px;">

            <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
              Revenue
            </div>

            <br>

            <div style="font-weight:bold;">
              Taxation
            </div>

            <ul style="margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:10px; padding-left:20px;">
              <li>Income Tax
                <span style="float:right;">[+ income_tax_display +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Property Tax
                <span style="float:right;">[+ property_tax_display +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Business Tax
                <span style="float:right;">[+ business_tax_display +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Customs
                <span style="float:right;">[+ customs_display +]</span>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div style="font-weight:bold;">
              State Enterprises
            </div>

            <ul style="margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:0; padding-left:20px;">
              <li>Monopolies
                <span style="float:right;">[+ monopolies_display +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Railways
                <span style="float:right;">[+ railway_revenue +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Enterprises
                <span style="float:right;">[+ enterprises_revenue +]</span>
              </li>
            </ul>

          </td>


          <!-- EXPENDITURE -->

          <td style="width:50%; vertical-align:top; padding-left:10px;">

            <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
              Expenditure
            </div>

            <br>

            <div style="font-weight:bold;">
              Government Functions
            </div>

            <ul style="margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:10px; padding-left:20px;">
              <li>Sovnarkom
                <span style="float:right;">[+ sovnarkom_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Foreign Affairs
                <span style="float:right;">[+ foreignaffairs_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Military
                <span style="float:right;">[+ military_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Enlightenment
                <span style="float:right;">[+ enlightenment_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Internal Affairs
                <span style="float:right;">[+ internal_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Railways
                <span style="float:right;">[+ railways_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Trade
                <span style="float:right;">[+ trade_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Finance
                <span style="float:right;">[+ finance_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Justice
                <span style="float:right;">[+ justice_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Labour
                <span style="float:right;">[+ labor_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Agriculture
                <span style="float:right;">[+ agriculture_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Food Supply
                <span style="float:right;">[+ foodsupply_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Nationalities
                <span style="float:right;">[+ nationalities_expend +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Welfare
                <span style="float:right;">[+ welfare_expend +]</span>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div style="font-weight:bold;">
              Other Obligations
            </div>

            <ul style="margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:0; padding-left:20px;">
              <li>Interest
                <span style="float:right;">[+ interest_display +]</span>
              </li>
              <li>Indemnities
                <span style="float:right;">[+ indemnities_display +]</span>
              </li>
            </ul>

          </td>

        </tr>
      </table>

      <hr>

      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr>
          <td style="width:50%;"><b>Total Revenue</b></td>
          <td style="width:50%; text-align:right;"><b>[+ income +]</b></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><b>Total Expenditure</b></td>
          <td style="text-align:right;"><b>[+ expenditure +]</b></td>
        </tr>
      </table>

    </div>


    <!-- LABOUR -->

    <div style="border:2px solid #666; border-radius:6px; padding:12px; margin-bottom:20px;">

      <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
        Labour
      </div>
      <hr>

      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr>
          <td>Wages</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ wages_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Employment</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ employment_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Labour Productivity</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ labour_productivity_display +]</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

    </div>


    <!-- ECONOMIC CONDITIONS -->

    <div style="border:2px solid #666; border-radius:6px; padding:12px;">

      <div style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
        Economic Conditions
      </div>
      <hr>

      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr>
          <td>Consumer Prices</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ consumer_prices_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Food Supply</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ food_supply_display +]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Living Standards</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">[+ living_standards_display +]</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

    </div>

  </div>

</div>



- @taxation
- @banking
- @administration
- @finance_null
- @seize_banks
- @repudiate_loans
- @root: Do not change finance
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action


@finance_null
title: -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
go-to: finance


@seize_banks
title: Seize the banks!
subtitle: Nationalize banks to allow us full control over fiscal policy. 
view-if: banks_seized = 0
on-arrival: banks_seized = 1; resources += 4; elite_unrest += 5; middle_unrest += 5; instability += 5; capital_flight_progress += 0.5;

@repudiate_loans
title: Repudiate all outstanding loans.
subtitle: This will free-up resources but substantially impact our foreign relations. 
view-if: repudiation = 0
choose-if: loans >= 0
unavailable-subtitle: We have no outstanding loans. 
on-arrival: repudiation = 1; loans_high = 0; loans_med = 0; loans_low = 0; bonds *= 0.65; uk_relation -= 35; france_relation -= 40; usa_relation -= 35; italy_relation -= 30; japan_relation -= 30; germany_relation -= 5; austria_relation -= 5; ottoman_relation -= 5; instability += 10; monthly_inflation += 0.5; capital_flight_progress += 1; 

@finance_return
title: Cancel action
go-to: finance

  

@taxation
title: TAXATION

- @adjust_income_taxes
- @raise_income_taxes
- @lower_income_taxes
- @raise_wealth_tax
- @lower_wealth_tax
- @raise_business_tax
- @lower_business_tax
- @finance_return

@raise_income_taxes
title: – Raise across the board.
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_1 += 0.5 if income_tax_rate_1 < 5; income_tax_rate_2 += 0.5 if income_tax_rate_2 < 5; income_tax_rate_3 += 0.5 if income_tax_rate_3 < 5; income_tax_rate_4 += 0.5 if income_tax_rate_4 < 5; income_tax_rate_5 += 0.5 if income_tax_rate_5 < 5; capital_flight_progress += 0.5; capital_flight_progress += 1 if income_tax_rate_1 >= 2.5; elite_unrest += 2.5; middle_unrest += 2.5; labor_unrest += 5; peasant_unrest += 5; kulak_unrest += 5; monthly_inflation -= 0.2;

Our tax increases hurts the livelihoods of workers and the middle class, and cuts into business confidence.

@lower_income_taxes
title: – Cut across the board.
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_1 -= 0.5 if income_tax_rate_1 >= 0.5; income_tax_rate_2 -= 0.5 if income_tax_rate_2 >= 0.5; income_tax_rate_3 -= 0.5 if income_tax_rate_3 >= 0.5; income_tax_rate_4 -= 0.5 if income_tax_rate_4 >= 0.5; income_tax_rate_5 -= 0.5 if income_tax_rate_5 >= 0.5; capital_flight_progress -= 1; elite_unrest -= 5; middle_unrest -= 5; labor_unrest -= 5; peasant_unrest -= 5; kulak_unrest -= 5; monthly_inflation += 0.2;

@adjust_income_taxes
title: Income Tax – Adjust current brackets. 
new-page: true

>**Income Tax:** [+ income_tax : taxation +]
>>**Bracket One:** [+ income_tax_rate_1 +]

>>**Bracket Two:** [+ income_tax_rate_2 +]

>>**Bracket Three:** [+ income_tax_rate_3 +]

>>**Bracket Four:** [+ income_tax_rate_4 +]

>>**Bracket Five:** [+ income_tax_rate_5 +]

- @raise_bracket1
- @lower_bracket1
- @raise_bracket2
- @lower_bracket2
- @raise_bracket3
- @lower_bracket3
- @raise_bracket4
- @lower_bracket4
- @raise_bracket5
- @lower_bracket5
- @finish_adjusting

@raise_bracket1
title: 🔼 Bracket One 
new-page: true
choose-if: income_tax_rate_1 < 5.0
unavailable-subtitle: The tax rate is already at the maximum. 
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_1 += 0.25; capital_flight_progress += 0.25; elite_unrest += 2.5; middle_unrest += 2.5; monthly_inflation -= 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@lower_bracket1
title: 🔻 Bracket One
new-page: true
choose-if: income_tax_rate_1 >= 0.25
unavailable-subtitle: Already set to zero. 
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_1 -= 0.25; capital_flight_progress -= 0.25; elite_unrest -= 2.5; middle_unrest -= 2.5; monthly_inflation += 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@raise_bracket2
title: 🔼 Bracket Two 
new-page: true
choose-if: income_tax_rate_2 < 5.0
unavailable-subtitle: The tax rate is already at the maximum. 
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_2 += 0.25; capital_flight_progress += 0.25; elite_unrest += 2.5; middle_unrest += 2.5; monthly_inflation -= 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@lower_bracket2
title: 🔻 Bracket Two 
new-page: true
choose-if: income_tax_rate_2 >= 0.25
unavailable-subtitle: Already set to zero. 
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_2 -= 0.25; capital_flight_progress -= 0.25; elite_unrest -= 2.5; middle_unrest -= 2.5; monthly_inflation += 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@raise_bracket3
title: 🔼 Bracket Three 
choose-if: income_tax_rate_3 < 5.0
unavailable-subtitle: The tax rate is already at the maximum. 
new-page: true
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_3 += 0.25; capital_flight_progress += 0.25; middle_unrest += 2.5; kulak_unrest += 1; monthly_inflation -= 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@lower_bracket3
title: 🔻 Bracket Three 
new-page: true
choose-if: income_tax_rate_3 >= 0.25
unavailable-subtitle: Already set to zero. 
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_3 -= 0.25; capital_flight_progress -= 0.25; middle_unrest -= 2.5; kulak_unrest -= 1; monthly_inflation += 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@raise_bracket4
title: 🔼 Bracket Four 
choose-if: income_tax_rate_4 < 5.0
unavailable-subtitle: The tax rate is already at the maximum. 
new-page: true
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_4 += 0.25; middle_unrest += 2.5; labor_unrest += 10; monthly_inflation -= 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@lower_bracket4
title: 🔻 Bracket Four 
new-page: true
choose-if: income_tax_rate_4 >= 0.25
unavailable-subtitle: Already set to zero. 
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_4 -= 0.25; middle_unrest -= 2.5; labor_unrest -= 10; monthly_inflation += 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@raise_bracket5
title: 🔼 Bracket Five 
choose-if: income_tax_rate_5 < 5.0
unavailable-subtitle: The tax rate is already at the maximum. 
new-page: true
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_5 += 0.25; labor_unrest += 5; peasant_unrest += 5; monthly_inflation -= 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@lower_bracket5
title: 🔻 Bracket Five 
new-page: true
choose-if: income_tax_rate_5 >= 0.25
unavailable-subtitle: Already set to zero. 
on-arrival: income_tax_rate_5 -= 0.25; labor_unrest -= 5; peasant_unrest -= 5; monthly_inflation += 0.05;
go-to: adjust_income_taxes

@finish_adjusting
title: Finish making adjustments 
go-to: finance

  
@raise_wealth_tax
title: Wealth Tax — Raise
on-arrival: wealth_tax_rate += 0.5; capital_flight_progress += 0.5; capital_flight_progress += 1 if wealth_tax_rate >= 2; elite_unrest += 10; middle_unrest += 5; labor_unrest -= 5; monthly_inflation -= 0.2;

We have raised taxes on wealth. 

@lower_wealth_tax
title: Wealth Tax — Lower
choose-if: wealth_tax_rate >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: The tax rate is already at zero. 
on-arrival: wealth_tax_rate -= 0.5; capital_flight_progress -= 0.5; elite_unrest -= 10; middle_unrest -= 5; labor_unrest += 5; monthly_inflation += 0.2;

We have lowered taxes on wealth. 

@raise_business_tax
title: Business Tax — Raise
on-arrival: business_tax_rate += 0.5; capital_flight_progress += 0.5; capital_flight_progress += 1 if business_tax_rate >= 2; elite_unrest += 5; middle_unrest += 5; labor_unrest -= 5; monthly_inflation -= 0.2;

We have raised taxes on business profits. 

@lower_business_tax
title: Business Tax — Lower
choose-if: business_tax_rate >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: The tax rate is already at zero. 
on-arrival: business_tax_rate -= 0.5; capital_flight_progress -= 0.5; elite_unrest -= 5; middle_unrest -= 5; labor_unrest += 5; monthly_inflation += 0.2;

We have lowered taxes on business profits. 




@banking
title: BANKING

- @finance_issue_currency
- @finance_bank_advances
- @finance_issue_bonds
- @pay_off_loans
- @finance_return

@finance_issue_currency
title: Issue additional currency. 
choose-if: banks_seized = 1
unavailable-subtitle: We lack control over the banks. 
subtitle: +5 resources
on-arrival: {!
    Q.resources += 5;
    Q.monthly_inflation += (1.2 * (Q.instability/12.5));
    Q.instability += 1;
!}

@finance_bank_advances
title: Borrow from the State Bank.
choose-if: banks_seized = 1
unavailable-subtitle: We lack control over the banks. 
subtitle: +5 resources
on-arrival: {!
    Q.resources += 5;
    Q.bank_advances += 5; 
    Q.monthly_inflation += (1.2 * (Q.instability/25));
    Q.instability += 0.25;
!}

@finance_issue_bonds
title: Issue government bonds.
subtitle: +5 resources
on-arrival: bonds += 5; resources += 5; instability += 0.5; monthly_inflation += (1.1 * (instability/50)); bond_rate += 1 if bonds > 90; bond_rate += 0.5 if ((bonds < 90) and (bonds > 60)); bond_rate += 0.25 if bonds < 60; 

@pay_off_loans
title: Repay our outstanding loans.
choose-if: loans >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no loans to repay. 




@administration
title: ADMINISTRATION

- @discipline
- @raise_salaries
- @finance_improve_admin
- @finance_hire_staff
- @finance_corruption
- @finance_return

@discipline
title: Practice budget discipline
subtitle: Cut salaries and benefits across the government. 
unavailable-subtitle: There is nothing left to cut.
choose-if: finance_efficacy > 0.25
on-arrival: efficacy_finance -= 0.1; efficacy_foreign -= 0.1; efficacy_military -= 0.1; efficacy_enlightenment -= 0.1; efficacy_internal -= 0.1; efficacy_railways -= 0.1; efficacy_trade -= 0.1; efficacy_justice -= 0.1; efficacy_agriculture -= 0.1; efficacy_foodsupply -= 0.1; efficacy_nationalities -= 0.1; efficacy_welfare -= 0.1; foreignaffairs_expend -= 0.25; military_expend -= 0.25; enlightmenet_expend -= 0.25; railways_expend -= 0.25; trade_expend -= 0.25; finance_expend -= 0.25; justice_expend -= 0.25; agriculture_expend -= 0.25; foodsupply_expend -= 0.25; nationalities_expend -= 0.25; welfare_expend -= 0.25; monthly_inflation -= 0.1; 

Cutting the budget hurts the workers and middle class, and also reduces the morale of the soldiers and railroad workers, two of the largest groups of government employees. This makes them less effective at their jobs.

@raise_salaries
title: Raise salary rates
subtitle: Raise salaries for government employees.
on-arrival: efficacy_finance += 0.15 if efficacy_finance < 1; efficacy_foreign += 0.15 if efficacy_foreign < 1; efficacy_military += 0.15 if efficacy_military < 1; efficacy_enlightenment += 0.15 if efficacy_enlightenment < 1; efficacy_internal += 0.15 if efficacy_internal < 1; efficacy_railways += 0.15 if efficacy_railways < 1; efficacy_trade += 0.15 if efficacy_trade < 1; efficacy_justice += 0.15 if efficacy_justice < 1; efficacy_agriculture += 0.15 if efficacy_agriculture < 1; efficacy_foodsupply += 0.15 if efficacy_foodsupply < 1; efficacy_nationalities += 0.15 if efficacy_nationalities < 1; efficacy_welfare += 0.15 if efficacy_welfare < 1; foreignaffairs_expend += 0.25; military_expend += 0.25; enlightmenet_expend += 0.25; railways_expend += 0.25; trade_expend += 0.25; finance_expend += 0.25; justice_expend += 0.25; agriculture_expend += 0.25; foodsupply_expend += 0.25; nationalities_expend += 0.25; welfare_expend += 0.25; monthly_inflation += 0.05; capital_flight_progress -= 0.5; 

@finance_improve_admin
title: Streamline department
subtitle: Cut waste and inefficiencies, increase labor intensity
on-arrival: efficacy_finance += 0.1 if efficacy_finance < 1; 

@finance_hire_staff
title: Hire administrative personnel
subtitle: -0.5 resources
on-arrival: efficacy_finance += 0.2 if efficacy_finance < 1; finance_expend += 0.25; resources -= 0.5;

@finance_corruption
title: Root-out departmental corruption. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
on-arrival: efficacy_finance += 0.1 if efficacy_finance < 1; resources -= 0.5;





